    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you make a Charisma check, you gain a bonus to the check equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of +1).</p><p>You also gain proficiency in one of these skills of your choice: Deception, Performance, or Persuasion.</p><section id=\"secret-G1217mPhZSkH8hBY\" class=\"secret\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which will automatically add the bonus to your Charisma checks.</p><p>You will be prompted to choose your proficiency as you level up.</p></section>",
